[2026-10-28 21:25:27.570 IFO][NeuroDragon] [vv] d-probe: chain arg11 mv dep=0x9f07dfdc00 wrapper=0x27a24b6eef0 holder=0x7df0000 resource=0x0 handle=0xffff why=noHolder native=0x0
[2026-10-28 21:25:27.571 IFO][NeuroDragon] [vv] d-probe: chain arg12 history dep=0x9f07dfe8b0 wrapper=0x27a24b6f5e0 holder=0x27a28392980 resource=0x27a294e1d30 handle=0x1a why=resolved native=0x27a2880f650

# arg11 (dep2) cannot be resolved at declaration: wrapper+0x10 is 0x7df0000, not a
# holder pointer. arg12 history does resolve there, arg9 colour does not. So the MV
# channel has no declarator-side source; it exists only in the draw's material bind.

